  "result": "I made the fix in `notify()` in `src/server/services/notification-service.ts`, but haven't run the tests.\n\n`notify()` sent a notification to everyone on the recipient list without checking who did the action, so when you commented on an issue you were assigned to, you were notified too. I added a line to the loop over recipients that skips the person who performed the action (`payload.actorId`). Other watchers still get notified.\n\nThe change sits in the shared `notify()`, so it applies to every notification type that has an actor: comments, mentions, assignments and member joins. For example, assigning an issue to yourself no longer notifies you. Overdue-issue notifications have no actor, so they are unaffected.",
